      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first commercial oil well in Texas was drilled in Corsicana in 1895, making it the first Texas oil boom town west of the Mississippi.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corsicana%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Corsicana hosts Bronze Statues of local historical figures throughout the city, preserving its heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
